<!--
    CIGRE B4's DC grid test system, whole: complements cigre-b4.xiidm (CigreB4Network.create, flat).

    The external grids GRA0 and GRB0 and the onshore power sources GA1, GB1, GB2 and GB3 infinite buses of 30 GVA, X/R 10, the
    brochure's. Converters averaged as cigre-dcs2-extensions.xml's, a 15 % phase reactor on their rating (R 0.003 pu), DC capacitors of
    40 ms, a bridge inductance for their blocking - a bipole's one converter of twice a pole's rating: onshore, and CBC2 offshore,
    grid-following (on their DC voltage, their droop or their power, as IIDM's control mode says), CMC1, CBD1, CME1 and CMF1 grid-forming
    (a virtual synchronous machine), each its island's. The offshore wind parks WTC1, WTC2, WTD1 and WTF1 Dynawo's WT4B example
    (ExampleNetworks.wt4bDynawoExample) on their own rating. Each DC line one lumped pi of its 400 kV conductor: a +-200 kV monopole's
    2 L and C / 2 of the brochure's per-km pole data, a +-400 kV bipole's L / 2 and 2 C (cables 2.615 mH and 0.2185 uF at +-200 kV,
    0.1908 uF at +-400 kV; OHLs 0.8273 mH, 0.0139 uF at +-200 kV, 0.9356 mH, 0.0123 uF at +-400 kV).
-->
